OL,3,GNEWSAHuge data centre plan sees
OL,4,Ahundreds attend meeting
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 400 people were at a public
OL,7,Fmeeting to share concerns about plans
OL,8,Fto build what would be one of the UK's
OL,9,Fbiggest data centres and accompanying
OL,10,Fsolar farms.
OL,12,FThe Longmarsh Green Energy (LGE)
OL,13,Fproject would cover 4,695 acres (1,900
OL,14,Fhectares) of farmland across two sites
OL,15,Fsouth of King's Lynn in Norfolk.
OL,17,FDr Martin Little, who leads the Stop
OL,18,FLongmarsh Energy (SLE) campaign group,
OL,19,Fsaid the proposal would "destroy"
OL,20,Ffarming land.
OL,23,APub: 03-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
